				{
					"id": 210360901,
					"content": "越野训练。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360902
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210360902,
					"content": "那就太好了，我们还是按照之前的那条越野路线锻炼吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孙宇"
				},
				{
					"id": 210360903,
					"content": "那位冒险家说，我只要尽快到达终点就好…但我每次用的时间都实在太长…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孙宇"
				},
				{
					"id": 210360904,
					"content": "所以，我想拜托你为我示范一下如何快速「越野」，我会在后面努力跟上的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360905,
						210360906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孙宇"
				},
				{
					"id": 210360905,
					"content": "没问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360908
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210360908,
					"content": "那就拜托你了，我们先去训练地点吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "孙宇"
				},
				{
					"id": 210360906,
					"content": "你可别被我甩远了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 210360907,
					"content": "咳…我…我努力跟上，但说实话，我的脚力实在是有限啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						210360908
